.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Appends a copy of the string
.I src
to the end of the string
.I dest.
The caller must ensure
.I dest
has enough space for the combined result.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the new length of dest.
.SH AUTHOR
Your Name <your.email@example.com>
